\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The dataset ablation study. All models are trained on the same training pipeline and hyperparameters. We ran the ablation on SEA-CLIP-Tiny using 3 choices: (c1) SEA blend, (c2) CC12M, and (c3) CC12M+SEA. We also tested on a single source of the SEA dataset, i.e., only WIT, Bloom, or CulturalGround (CG). We use \texttt  {R@1-Avg} from Total Average@1 in Table~\ref {tab:per_task}.}}{1}{}\protected@file@percent }
